:R-HSA-450531  a            owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0043488 ;
        rdfs:comment        "RNA elements rich in adenine and uracil residues (AU-rich elements) bind specific proteins which either target the RNA for degradation or, more rarely, stabilize the RNA. The activity of the AU-element binding proteins is regulated, usually by phosphorylation but also by subcellular localization." ;
